  "title": "India's E-Visa Expansion and India's Energy Crisis",
  "summary": "India's e-visa expansion and new ports include 11 international ports and 9 land ports, while India faces a critical energy crisis due to global supply disruptions and reliance on critical energy sources.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The Ministry of Home Affairs has announced the expansion of India's e-visa entry network to include 11 international ports and 9 land ports, including the newly added land port Attari on the India-Pakistan border.",
